            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Information on Trading Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading cards will be included in Box Maze 2 as soon as we reach the &quot;confidence metric&quot; recently introduced by Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682630/extras/953fb05cece644d637aa3640f10d85e6.avif?t=1784051506\" width=620 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump back into the life of Cubert, who, after saving his girlfriend from Red, has signed up for the S.S.B. (Secret Services of Boxes). Your mission as Agent Cubert is to save Gaston's daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through 100 exciting new levels while avoiding dangerous hazards like poison pits, blades, spikes, and new enemies. Your goal is to progress through increasingly difficult levels, collecting pizza, sweets, and jelly beans to boost your score. Gather potions to defeat enemies. Unlock achievements and discover secret messages as you navigate unique levels, each offering various completion routes and numerous hazards. Test your reflexes and your ability to find the quickest paths to reach the warp and advance to the next level. Box Maze 2 is a fun and humorous game designed to challenge your memory, reflexes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682630/extras/4980ff91bc3e8a5a28546bbe4e82e8a2.avif?t=1784051506\" width=620 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a complete overhaul of graphics and animations to enhance the visual appeal! Box Maze 2 features a 2D platformer style with 3D effects, offering much better graphics and new animations for all enemies, characters, and hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682630/extras/c089e038549d50381b4f6ee417aa6277.webp?t=1784051506\" width=150 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve revamped the GUI and menu system to make them more user-friendly and visually appealing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682630/extras/f51fb21f475fc704f7bde474696ed754.webp?t=1784051506\" width=150 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box Maze 2 introduces more enemies, including water enemies, fire enemies, bomber boxes, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682630/extras/c5362e8c6447046d9545424234ed203b.webp?t=1784051506\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682630/extras/21a0aa36eca1523b1c26da5fac9d09e2.avif?t=1784051506\" width=620 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New hazards like poison, blades, and spikes await! Navigate through these challenges to reach the warp and progress through each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682630/extras/bc7172c9bbfb6386c39ec8d237249fe1.avif?t=1784051506\" width=620 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect pizza, sweets, and jelly beans to boost your total score, as well as individual scores for each collectible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682630/extras/66e8bfeefc9a17629d5f4eddc4369e28.avif?t=1784051506\" width=650 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character's appearance with skin packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682630/extras/97c1e8e17f7b9a9cd5eb18d80839090a.webp?t=1784051506\" width=150 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box Maze 2 will feature over 200 achievements. Why so many? Because reaching 100% completion won't be a quick or easy task! Many achievements will be earned by completing levels, completing tasks, and uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682630/extras/134ff6907303cca0179592052adf3361.webp?t=1784051506\" width=150 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Engaging storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Scoreboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Death counter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Various hazards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Level select</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Character skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. New collectibles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. Player-made levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. Secret levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Steam Marketplace (Coming Soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11. Steam Trading Cards (Coming Soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12. Community-created character skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13. Community-created levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14. Community-created enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15. And much more!</p>",
